      "refersTo": "nav-active",
      "description": "Forest rail navigation with an explicit active destination.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Preview navigation\"><button aria-current=\"page\">Today</button><button>Coach</button><button>My plan</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;background:var(--forest,#183f32);padding:21px;width:228px}.ds-nav button{font-family:Manrope,Arial,sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:47px;padding:10px 16px;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:none;color:#cad8c8;font-size:13px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav button:hover{background:#28503e;color:#fff}.ds-nav button[aria-current]{background:var(--lime,#d7ef9d);color:#234b31;font-weight:750}.ds-nav button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #739b47;outline-offset:4px;}"
